;                                                           
;  Project     = Sample program for flash self-programming  
;  Module      = sample_c.dr                                
;  Version     = V2.30                                      
;  Target CPU  = 78K0R/KE3-L( uPD78F1009 / QB-78K0RKE3L-TB )
;  Environment = PM plus(V6.31)                             
;                RA78K0R(V1.31)                             
;                CC78K0R(V2.10)                             
;  Date        = July 23, 2009                              
